  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Analysis of Potential Interventions for Clean Cooking in Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of this consultancy are to identify a set of effective interventions &#x2013; policies, investments and technical assistance &#x2013; to control air emissions from the residential cooking sector. The objectives will be achieved through to tasks: 1.Identification of clean cooking interventions to be potentially financed by the BCAP and Task 2-Recommendations of potential interventions.</narrative>
